MssURI

This field indicates the format of the signature that should be created. The supported types are:

·        http://uri.etsi.org/TS102204/v1.1.2#PKCS7 is used in Single Signing(Single Signature Request)

·        http://uri.etsi.org/TS102204/v1.1.2#XML-Signature is used in Single Signing(Single Signature Request)

·        trmobilesignature:MultipleSignature, is used in  Multiple Signing( Multiple Signature Request)

 

